    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Actually, after this PR, simply hovering one of `C://pagefile.sys`, `C://swapfile.sys` or `C://DumpStack.log.tmp` and then moving the cursor on top of any other file on the `C:/` directory will result in a similar error to the one described in #2272 with the same minimal reproduction\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n    require(\"mini.files\").setup {\r\n      windows = {\r\n        preview = true,\r\n      },\r\n    }\r\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd(\"User\", {\r\n      pattern = \"MiniFilesWindowUpdate\",\r\n      callback = function()\r\n        local s = MiniFiles.get_explorer_state()\r\n      end,\r\n    })\r\n```",
